 "caption": "It stands in a rail, the navigation and the content attached, at the body's full width: the rail stands shut to its icons, and on a phone one bar stands at the top. A record of a few facts and nothing else opens beside its list at a desktop, as a drawer, under its list on a tablet, and as a screen of its own on a phone. In the drawer its name is the title and the action that closes it stands in its header. Its facts are readings, each a title with its value under it, with no table. Every screen shows the same facts of the record; on a phone the record has the screen to itself, drawn here without the list.",
